# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
# Symbol table, English. Modelled on NVDA's symbols.dic (Copyright NVDA contributors,
# GPL-2.0-or-later, https://github.com/nvaccess/nvda) as a reference. Many names and levels
# coincide with NVDA's table; see THIRD-PARTY.md. The format, identifiers and the @word.* strings are gorca's own.
# Fields (tab separated): symbol, spoken name, level, preserve.
#   symbol: one character, "U+XXXX", the literal "...", or "@id" for a complex rule or word.
#   level: none (always spoken), some, most, all, char (only when one character is read).
#   preserve: never (default), always (keep the mark for prosody), norep (keep it when not named).
@sentence.dot	dot	all	always
@sentence.bang	bang	all	always
@sentence.question	question	all	always
@phrase.semi	semicolon	most	always
@phrase.colon	colon	most	always
@multiple.dot	multiple dots	all	always
@decimal.point		none	always
@decimal.comma		none	always
@inword.apostrophe	apostrophe	all	norep
@negative.number	minus	none	norep
U+0000	blank	char
U+0009	tab	char
U+000A	blank	char
U+000D	blank	char
U+000C	page break	none
U+0020	space	char
U+00A0	space	char
U+2009	space	char
U+202F	space	char
U+200B	zero width space	char
U+200E	left to right mark	char
U+200F	right to left mark	char
!	bang	all
"	quote	most
U+0023	number	some
$	dollar	all	norep
£	pound	all	norep
€	euro	all	norep
¢	cents	all	norep
¥	yen	all	norep
₹	rupee	some	norep
₽	ruble	some	norep
₴	hryvnia	some	norep
%	percent	some
‰	per mille	some
&	and	some
'	apostrophe	all
(	left paren	most	always
)	right paren	most	always
*	star	some
+	plus	some
,	comma	all	always
-	dash	most	always
.	dot	some
/	slash	some
:	colon	most	norep
;	semicolon	most
<	less	some
=	equals	some
>	greater	some
?	question	all
U+0040	at	some
[	left bracket	most
]	right bracket	most
\	backslash	most
^	caret	most
_	underscore	most
`	grave	most
{	left brace	most
}	right brace	most
|	bar	most
~	tilde	most
¦	broken bar	most
¡	inverted bang	some
¿	inverted question	some
·	middle dot	most
„	low double quote	most
“	left quote	most
”	right quote	most
‘	left single quote	most
’	right single quote	most
′	prime	some
″	double prime	some
•	bullet	some
…	ellipsis	all	always
...	ellipsis	all	always
–	en dash	most	always
—	em dash	most	always
‐	hyphen	most	always
«	left guillemet	most	always
»	right guillemet	most	always
§	section	all
°	degrees	some
©	copyright	some
®	registered	some
™	trademark	some
№	number sign	some
µ	micro	some
¶	paragraph mark	most
±	plus or minus	some
×	times	some
÷	divided by	some
−	minus	most	always
≈	approximately	some
≠	not equal	some
≤	less or equal	some
≥	greater or equal	some
→	right arrow	some
←	left arrow	some
∞	infinity	some
